Package: docdesigner
Title: Publication-Inspired Templates for Research PDFs and Slides
Version: 1.0.1
Authors@R: person("Joseph N.", "Cohen", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "joseph.cohen@qc.cuny.edu")
Description: Pandoc/R Markdown templates for research papers, book chapters,
    reports, briefs, snapshots, and ioslides presentations. Provides
    publication-inspired style presets for researchers who want polished,
    audience-aware PDF and slide outputs from R.
